## Typing stubs for auth0-python

This is a [type stub package](https://typing.python.org/en/latest/tutorials/external_libraries.html)
for the [`auth0-python`](https://github.com/auth0/auth0-python) package. It can be used by type checkers
to check code that uses `auth0-python`. This version of
`types-auth0-python` aims to provide accurate annotations for
`auth0-python==4.10.*`.

*Note:* The `auth0-python` package includes type annotations or type stubs
since version 5.4.0. Please uninstall the `types-auth0-python`
package if you use this or a newer version.


This package is part of the [typeshed project](https://github.com/python/typeshed).
All fixes for types and metadata should be contributed there.
See [the README](https://github.com/python/typeshed/blob/main/README.md)
for more details. The source for this package can be found in the
[`stubs/auth0-python`](https://github.com/python/typeshed/tree/main/stubs/auth0-python)
directory.

This package was tested with the following type checkers:
* [mypy](https://www.mypy-lang.org/) 2.4.0
* [pyrefly](https://pyrefly.org/) 1.4.0
* [pyright](https://microsoft.github.io/pyright/) 1.1.414
* [ty](https://docs.astral.sh/ty/) 0.0.91

It was generated from typeshed commit
[`272d38680771baf39c7ea503ae5d042c3295e47c`](https://github.com/python/typeshed/commit/272d38680771baf39c7ea503ae5d042c3295e47c).
